WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.158
Can you fold it without the diagram?

00:00:03.158 --> 00:00:06.316
Recognition and independent action differ.

00:00:06.316 --> 00:00:09.474
Learning science studies monitoring of understanding.

00:00:09.474 --> 00:00:12.632
A 2018 synthesis reviewed learning evidence.

00:00:12.632 --> 00:00:15.789
Monitoring, feedback and adjustment are part of learning.

00:00:15.789 --> 00:00:22.105
Predict what you can already do.

00:00:22.105 --> 00:00:28.421
Close the material. Explain or perform.

00:00:28.421 --> 00:00:34.737
Compare actual performance with the prediction.

00:00:34.737 --> 00:00:41.053
Specific gaps guide the next step.

00:00:41.053 --> 00:00:44.211
Confidence helps, but cannot prove mastery.

00:00:44.211 --> 00:00:47.368
One correct answer does not guarantee transfer.

00:00:47.368 --> 00:00:50.526
Difficult tasks need understanding and feedback.

00:00:50.526 --> 00:00:56.842
Explain correlation using a new everyday example.

00:00:56.842 --> 00:01:03.158
Check unclear parts against a reliable source.

00:01:03.158 --> 00:01:06.316
Turn a global judgment into a specific next step.

00:01:06.316 --> 00:01:09.474
Know your learning while learning the subject.

00:01:09.474 --> 00:01:12.632
Revised expectations can reveal a direction.

00:01:12.632 --> 00:01:15.789
Let each attempt leave usable feedback.
